# Goal: RGB and optional depth image for snapshot prediction
sensor_msgs/Image rgb_image
sensor_msgs/Image depth_image
---
# Result: Detected entities and processing status
arlab_knowledge_interfaces/Entity[] entities
bool success
string error_message
---
# Feedback: Processing status updates
string status
float32 progress  # 0.0 to 1.0
int32 objects_detected  # Number of objects detected so far
